#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure_stack/azure_stack.rst:35
msgid ""
"By default, the Azure Stack management url's are not accessible from an "
"external network. Port mappings and DNS must be configured for communication"
" between the |morpheus| Appliance and Azure Stack."
msgstr ""
"By predeterminado, el Azure Stack management url's no son accessible desde "
"un externo network. Port mappings y DNS debe ser configurado para "
"communication entre el |morpheus| Appliance y Azure Stack."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure_stack/azure_stack.rst:37
msgid ""
"In order to communicate with Azure Stack, |morpheus| must be able to reach "
"the internal Azure Stack network. The Azure Stack Portal needs to be exposed"
" to the |morpheus| Appliances' network with corresponding entries added to "
"DNS."
msgstr ""
"In order to communicate con Azure Stack, |morpheus| debe be able to reach el"
" interno Azure Stack network. The Azure Stack Portal necesita ser exposed to"
" el |morpheus| Appliances' network con corresponding entries agregado to "
"DNS."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure_stack/azure_stack.rst:39
msgid ""
"One option to expose the Internal Azure Stack network to the |morpheus| "
"Appliances network is to use the ``Expose-AzureStackPortal.ps1`` powershell "
"script from https://gallery.technet.microsoft.com/scriptcenter/Expose-the-"
"Azure-Stack-7ef68b19. An Azure Stack Port Mapping Tool is also available."
msgstr ""
"One opción to expose el Internal Azure Stack network to el |morpheus| "
"Appliances network es to use el ``Expose-AzureStackPortal.ps1`` powershell "
"script desde https://gallery.technet.microsoft.com/scriptcenter/Expose-the-"
"Azure-Stack-7ef68b19. An Azure Stack Port Mapping Tool es también "
"disponible."

